package views

// Card renders the .position-group bordered-card pattern - originally the
// roster builder's per-position card, since reused verbatim (bordered
// div + h3 title) wherever a page needs "one bordered card per item"
// (billing plan boxes, song-tag-suggestion groups, this style guide's own
// demo). Factored out so that reuse goes through one component instead of
// each caller hand-copying the div/h3 skeleton. Positions that also need
// the collapsible open/close behavior use collapsibleCard
// (internal/views/scheduling/collapsible.templ) instead - a different,
// richer shape this doesn't cover.
templ Card(title string) {
	<div class="position-group">
		<h3>{ title }</h3>
		{ children... }
	</div>
}
